      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i've already checked the basic stuff like system load and it looks fine when it happens. the connection resets are the most annoying part though. it feels totally random, like there's just some glitchy thing messing with the packets or the container lifecycle while it's running. do you have any specific tools or methods for sniffing out what exactly is causing that instability in the network layer during the test run?",
